<title>GERMANY: Ballmaier &amp; Schulz to launch Surgutneftegaz ADR.</title>
<headline>Ballmaier &amp; Schulz to launch Surgutneftegaz ADR.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German broker Ballmaier &amp; Schulz Wertpapier said on Friday it would launch the Russian gas company Surgutneftegaz on the German bourse on Tuesday January 14.</p>
<p>The broker said that American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) in Russia's second-biggest gas producer would be traded on the Berlin stock exchange on that day.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
